 {'from': 'human', 'value': 'How can I develop a Swift program that can generate a diverse set of knock-knock jokes using different themes, puns, and wordplays? The program should be able to come up with a clever setup and punchline that follows the knock-knock joke format and elicits laughter and entertainment from the listeners. Furthermore, can the program classify the jokes based on humor, complexity, and length and present them in a table for further examination and refinement?
