 {'from': 'gpt', 'value': 'Welcome to the virtual reality experience that will take you on a journey of entrepreneurship. This interactive experience will allow you to step into the shoes of a tech entrepreneur and navigate through the challenges and triumphs of building a successful startup.
As you put on your VR headset, you will find yourself in the middle of a bustling city, with skyscrapers towering above you. You are standing in front of a building with a sign that reads "Startup Incubator." This is where your journey begins.
