 {'from': 'human', 'value': 'In order to enhance language understanding, a new method has been proposed. It\'s a machine learning technique that involves training a neural network to generate outputs by analyzing inputs. This method is called "sequential decision making with the gradient-based reinforcement learning algorithm". Can you guess the acronym for this technique? It\'s a three-letter word starting with "P".'}
